      "message": "BlockedReasons is used for onAvailable and onBlockedStatusChanged Callback.\nIf apps does not have INTERNET permission, this will not changed so blocked reasons for this app will always contain BLOCKED_REASON_INTERNET_PERMISSION.\nApps will receive callback immediately after registration and if blockedReasons changed, apps would receive onBlockedStatusChanged with new blockedReasons.\n\nI don\u0027t think this behavior is particularly useful but I don\u0027t think ConnectivityService should send callback with blocked\u003dfalse or blockedReasons\u003dBLOCKED_REASON_NONE.",
